### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List attachments for an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/attachments
Accept: application/json

### List attachments for an item unit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/units/1/attachments
Accept: application/json

### List attachments for a borrowing request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1/attachments
Accept: application/json

### Get attachment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/1
Accept: application/json

### Download attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/1/download
Accept: application/json

### Upload attachment (form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Accept: application/json

### Parameters for form-data:
### attachable_type: App\Models\ItemUnit
### attachable_id: 1
### type: condition_after
### file: [select file]

### Delete attachment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/attachments/1